Package: reactableduckdb
Type: Package
Title: Serve 'reactable' Tables from Lazy 'DuckDB' Queries
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Parker", "Barnes",
      email = "barnesparker1@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Streams a lazy 'duckplyr' or 'dbplyr' query backed by 'DuckDB'
    into a 'reactable' widget through reactable's custom server-side data
    backend API. DuckDB performs all filtering, counting, sorting, and
    pagination; R only ever materializes a zero-row schema prototype, a
    scalar filtered count, and the requested page of rows. Unsupported
    behaviour errors loudly instead of silently falling back to eager
    execution.
